# OpenRouter API key — the only credential this project needs.
# Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# Only app/agent/provider.py reads this. Phases 00-04 do not use it at all;
# the policy engine, calendar, retrieval and access control contain no model
# call, so the entire correctness-bearing core runs and tests without a key.
